{
  "slug": "lisa",
  "name": "Lisa",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Interactive specification interview workflow that conducts in-depth feature interviews using AskUserQuestion and generates comprehensive specs. Lisa plans. Ralph does.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `cleanup` (Clean up all Lisa interview state files), `help` (Explain the lisa workflow), `plan` (Start a specification interview for a feature), `resume` (Resume an interrupted specification interview)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lisa@claude-community` from `blencorp/lisa`.",
